      "text": "There are excursion boats that go from the port of Psathi around the island and also to the nearby island of Poliegos which has some of the most beautiful sea in Greece, though you could say the same about Kimolos too. Also keep in mind that if you have a car, the island of Milos is so close that it too is easily explorable.",
