      "evidence_id": "e-1e9d6e2786a0d963e8b3",
      "text": "Kimolos is protected by legislation that makes large-scale construction and overdevelopment difficult, Paraskevopoulos says, explaining why everything feels so wonderfully unhurried. \"There are no traffic jams, no crowds spilling from cruise ships and no airport bringing a constant stream of arrivals. That absence is part of the magic.”",
